/// Turn runtime projection
///
/// Contract:
/// - Experience owns the runtime read surface for program/turn execution.
/// - Experience remains the runtime lifecycle owner for `Turn` objects.
/// - Keeps turn execution visibility aligned with Experience-owned Program runtime.
projection Turn {
    root turn.Turn
    turn.Turn::feedbacks

    observable turn {
        """
        Runtime turn execution surface (accepted -> running -> feedback* -> terminal).
        """
    }
}
